     "object": "p_r_yirmeya_badak",
     "gloss_en": "R' Yirmeya inspected a bird and found like two beans lying at the opening of the skull"
    }
   ]
  },
  "2": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.3",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chalal_halev_knei_halev",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_mi_la_tenan_simpon_gadol",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "מאי תיבעי לך? מי לא תנן: רבי שמעון אומר עד שתינקב לבית הסמפונות, ואמר רב: עד שתינקב לסמפון גדול -- as R' Shimon's bronchi are the large bronchus, so the mishna's chamber is the large one",
     "supports": "p_chalal_gadol",
     "status": "rejected"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_nikav_halev",
     "gloss_en": "the heart was perforated to its chamber [-- tereifa]"
    }
   ]
  },
  "3": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.4",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chalal_halev_knei_halev",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support_deflection",
     "object": "defl_hachi_hashta",
     "gloss_en": "הכי השתא? התם לבית הסמפונות קתני -- להיכא דשפכי סמפונות כולהו; והכא לבית חללו קתני -- the plural there points to the one bronchus into which all empty; the singular chamber here points to neither",
     "deflects": "s_mi_la_tenan_simpon_gadol",
     "refuted": false
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_chalal_gadol_o_katan",
     "gloss_en": "here it teaches 'to its chamber' -- what is it to me a large chamber, what a small one: either"
    }
   ]
  },
  "4": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.5",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chalal_halev_knei_halev",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rav_mashehu",
     "gloss_en": "the aorta: Rav -- [tereifa when perforated] by any amount"
    }
   ]
  },
  "5": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.6",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chalal_halev_knei_halev",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rav_chelev_al_dfanot",
     "gloss_en": "Rav: [the aorta is the vessel in] the fat upon the sides"
    }
   ]
  },
  "6": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.7",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chalal_halev_knei_halev",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_tlata_knei",
     "gloss_en": "there are three ducts: one goes to the heart, one to the lung, one to the liver"
    }
   ]
  },
  "7": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.8",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chalal_halev_knei_halev",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_dreia_kekavda",
     "gloss_en": "(reversed) the lung's [duct] is as the liver"
    }
   ]
  },
  "8": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.9",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chalal_halev_knei_halev",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_lo_yada_bitreifot",
     "gloss_en": "Shmuel: if Abba [Rav] said so, he knows nothing at all of tereifot"
    }
   ]
  },
  "13": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.14",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chut_hashidra_nifsak",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_ts_nayyoli_rav_huna",
     "kind": "ta_shema",
     "gloss_en": "תא שמע, דאמר ניולי אמר רב הונא: רובו שאמרו רוב עורו, מוח זה לא מעלה ולא מוריד",
     "supports": "p_rov_mocho_vehaor_kayam_kesheira",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rov_mocho_vehaor_kayam_kesheira",
     "gloss_en": "[with most of the membrane intact,] this nerve tissue neither raises nor lowers -- its severing alone does not make a tereifa"
    }
   ]
  },
  "16": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.17",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chut_hashidra_nifsak",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "o_meitivi_rsbe_nitmazmez",
     "kind": "meitivi",
     "gloss_en": "מיתיבי: רבי שמעון בן אלעזר אומר בהמה שנתמזמז מוחה טרפה -- against Bei Rav's 'emptied -- fit'",
     "against": "p_nitmazmez_kasher",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_nitmasmes_itmar",
     "gloss_en": "ההיא נתמסמס איתמר -- the baraita's word is 'softened', not 'emptied'",
     "answers": "o_meitivi_rsbe_nitmazmez",
     "restores": "p_nitmazmez_kasher"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_mipnei_kovdo_pasul",
     "gloss_en": "[the spinal cord] cannot stand because of its weight -- [is it unfit?]"
    }
   ]
  },
  "17": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.18",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chut_hashidra_nifsak",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "o_ini_levi_bei_masuta",
     "kind": "maaseh",
     "gloss_en": "איני? והא לוי... אמר נתמזמז מוחיה דדין, לאו דלא חיי? -- Levi's remark implies an emptied nerve tissue is fatal",
     "against": "p_nitmazmez_kasher",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_abaye_sheeino_molid",
     "gloss_en": "לא, לומר שאינו מוליד -- Levi meant only that he cannot beget",
     "answers": "o_ini_levi_bei_masuta",
     "restores": "p_nitmazmez_kasher"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_levi_nitmazmez_mocheih",
     "gloss_en": "Levi, of a man who struck his head: this one's nerve tissue is emptied"
    }
   ]
  },
  "9": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.10",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chut_hashidra_nifsak",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_nishbera_hashidra",
     "gloss_en": "the spine was broken [and its cord severed -- tereifa]"
    }
   ]
  },
  "10": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.11",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chut_hashidra_nifsak",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_halakha_ke_r_yaakov",
     "gloss_en": "Rebbi ruled [in practice] as R' Yaakov"
    }
   ]
  },
  "11": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.12",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chut_hashidra_nifsak",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rubo_rov_oro",
     "gloss_en": "Rav: [its majority means] the majority of its membrane"
    }
   ]
  },
  "12": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.13",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chut_hashidra_nifsak",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_kol_sheken_rov_oro",
     "gloss_en": "per the one who says 'the majority of its nerve tissue' -- all the more so the majority of its membrane"
    }
   ]
  },
  "14": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.15",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chut_hashidra_nifsak",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rnba_badak_rov_mocho",
     "gloss_en": "R' Natan bar Avin checked the majority of the membrane and went on to check the majority of the nerve tissue"
    }
   ]
  },
  "15": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.16",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chut_hashidra_nifsak",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_nitmarech_pasul",
     "gloss_en": "[the spinal cord] liquefied -- unfit"
    }
   ]
  },
  "18": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.19",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chut_hashidra_nifsak",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ad_bein_haparashot",
     "gloss_en": "the spinal cord [whose severing makes a tereifa] runs until between the branches"
    }
   ]
  },
  "19": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.20",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chut_hashidra_nifsak",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_lo_yedia",
     "gloss_en": "Rav Yehuda: [in a fat kid] they are too buried and not recognisable; [in a lean one] too protruding and not recognisable"
    }
   ]
  },
  "20": {
   "segId": "Chullin.45b.21",
   "sugya": "chullin_45b_chut_hashidra_nifsak",
   "marks": [
